        "congress": 119,
        "constitutionalAuthorityStatementText": "<pre>\n[Congressional Record Volume 171, Number 1 (Friday, January 3, 2025)]\n[House]\nFrom the Congressional Record Online through the Government Publishing Office [<a href=\"https://www.gpo.gov\">www.gpo.gov</a>]\nBy Mr. BEGICH:\nH.R. 42.\nCongress has the power to enact this legislation pursuant\nto the following:\nArticle 1, Section 8\nThe single subject of this legislation is:\nExcluding all amounts distributed or benefits provided by a\nSettlement Trust to blind, disabled, and Alaska Native Elders\nand their descendants when determining eligibility for\ngovernmental benefits.\n[Page H37]\n</pre>",
